# Pipeline state files that USED to be local-only.
# Now tracked so GitHub Actions cron has continuity:
#   pipeline/history.json          — YouTube velocity snapshots (Step 1)
#   pipeline/social_history.json   — IG/TT velocity snapshots (Step 1)
#   pipeline/rejected.json         — manual blocklist curation (Step 2)
#   pipeline/candidates.json       — discovery output (Step 2)
#   pipeline/channel_denylist.json — channel curation (Step 2)

